              "is_header": false,
              "row": 1,
              "rowspan": 1,
              "text": "Alphabet Inc."
            }
          ],
          "column_count": 6,
          "row_count": 2
        },
        "text": "Table of ContentsAlphabet Inc.",
        "text_hash": "2f8c99ac0bba90fcf6bfbc211cf5f2a488da9b5f380b95023f9e4d2c09546ec6",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000088-778b3180",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[95]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 88,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our products and services have come a long way since the company was founded more than 25 years ago. While Google Search started as a way to find web pages, organized into ten blue links, we have driven technical advancements and product innovations that have transformed Google Search into a dynamic, multimodal experience. Large language models have made it possible to express more natural language queries, vastly improving the types of questions users can ask, and the quality of results. For example, AI Overviews makes it easier to ask Google anything and get a helpful response. AI Mode allows users to ask more nuanced questions that might have previously taken multiple searches, using Gemini’s advanced reasoning, thinking, and multimodal capabilities.",
        "text_hash": "778b3180e1d3e2ae55cbb71f6cbc741761b62618871bf62effbdc29206be5acb",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000089-eec5429f",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[96]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 89,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "This drive to make information more accessible and helpful has led us over the years to improve the discovery and creation of digital content both on the web and through platforms like Google Play and YouTube. People are consuming many forms of digital content, including watching long and short form videos and podcasts, streaming TV, playing games, listening to music, reading books, and using apps. Working with content creators and partners, we continue to build new ways for people around the world to create and find great digital content.",
        "text_hash": "eec5429fd49f68bb1fe17a36a52b337b53f6d847c72bf7186d3d0348afbc435a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000090-f900cbea",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[97]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 90,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Fueling all of these great digital experiences are extraordinary platforms and devices. That is why we continue to invest in platforms like our Android mobile operating system, Chrome browser, and Chrome operating system, as well as our family of devices. We see tremendous potential for devices to be helpful and make people's lives easier by combining the best of our AI, software, and hardware. This potential is reflected in our latest generation of devices, such as the new Pixel 10 series and the Pixel Watch 4. Creating products and services that people rely on every day is a journey that we are investing in for the long-term.",
        "text_hash": "f900cbeac5c8ce8c91b93579aaf11cceda09dc588443f21633bead87bf3bf55c",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000091-fbbe030c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[98]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 91,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-style",
            "italic"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "700"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "How We Make Money",
        "text_hash": "fbbe030c198cb4d3861b303c5f6577772ecf4cedd675a80502addd049a5262ee",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000092-02c6e3d3",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[99]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 92,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "We have built world-class advertising technologies for advertisers, agencies, and publishers to power their digital marketing businesses. Our advertising solutions help millions of companies grow their businesses through our wide range of products across devices and formats, and we aim to ensure positive user experiences by serving the right ads at the right time and by building deep partnerships with brands and agencies. AI has been foundational to our advertising business for more than a decade. Products like Demand Gen, Performance Max, and Product Studio use the full power of our AI to help advertisers find untapped and incremental conversion opportunities.",
        "text_hash": "02c6e3d34a01c9f206ace7c047738a79154602c4e1425b716f2c325195410664",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000093-0c7f9036",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[100]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 93,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Google Services generates revenues primarily by delivering both performance and brand advertising that appears on Google Search & other properties, YouTube, and Google Network partners' properties (\"Google Network properties\"). We continue to invest in both performance and brand advertising and seek to improve the measurability of advertising so advertisers understand the effectiveness of their campaigns.",
        "text_hash": "0c7f90368d1c0afccc25c1019c26787fda62248d39a91b6c43d6761b322bd7a1",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000094-e4c14dea",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[101]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 94,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "700"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "padding-left",
            "36pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "-18pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Performance advertising creates and delivers relevant ads that users will click on leading to direct engagement with advertisers. Performance advertising lets our advertisers connect with users while driving measurable results. Our ads tools allow performance advertisers to create simple text-based ads.",
        "text_hash": "e4c14dea6e1392ccf690818ca9d24be02d6a3339cacb864f5b3bde406626643a",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000095-9dac0973",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[102]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 95,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "700"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "padding-left",
            "36pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "-18pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Brand advertising helps enhance users' awareness of and affinity for advertisers' products and services, through videos, text, images, and other interactive ads that run across various devices. We help brand advertisers deliver digital videos and other types of ads to specific audiences for their brand-building marketing campaigns.",
        "text_hash": "9dac0973a1e785f28b73570e1d02688aa82354196daa30577d951d3a96142a06",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000096-ac27b3a6",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[103]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 96,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "We have allocated substantial resources to stopping bad advertising practices and protecting users on the web. We focus on creating the best advertising experiences for our users and advertisers in many ways, including filtering out invalid traffic, removing billions of bad ads from our systems every year, and closely monitoring the sites, apps, and videos where ads appear and blocklisting them when necessary to ensure that ads do not fund bad content.",
        "text_hash": "ac27b3a629a077793300a177216a37131ba35f2e2ce6e874c9314de0a6d57582",
        "type": "paragraph"
      }
    ],
